# CueDone icon freeze

The official favicon/extension mark is already approved:

- Black C
- Cream background
- Orange/amber forward arrow

Source files: `icons/icon16.png`, `icons/icon32.png`, `icons/icon48.png`, `icons/icon128.png`.

Do not redesign, recolor, recrop, regenerate, or reinterpret these icons. Do not replace them with a checkmark or a new mark. Leave the `icons/` files unchanged unless the user explicitly asks to replace the approved icon set.
